  "주관적 현장 점검. 구역별 환경 편차 누적. 환기·난방 과잉 운전. 생육 문제 원인 추적 어려움.": "Subjective site checks. Accumulating zone-level variation. Over-operation of ventilation and heating. Growth issues hard to trace.",
